//
// CPU-only geometry verification for the rn3 3x3+3x3 pair tile fusion
// (Phase H prototype). Confirms that one (T+4)×(T+4) original-input patch
// is sufficient to compute one T×T fused-pair output tile — the
// pre-condition for an on-device dataflow-fused implementation.
//
// No NPU dispatch; sub-second.
//
// REQUIRES: peano, torch
//
// RUN: python3 %S/conv/test_rn3_pair_cpu.py
